      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783980067899,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "--- Why URL state matters -- A URL-driven model enables:\n* Bookmarking\n* Sharing\n* Opening listings in new tabs\n* Browser back and forward navigation\n* Server rendering\n* Analytics attribution\n* Deep links from blogs and search engines\n* Reliable refresh and session restoration",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--- Why URL state matters -- A URL-driven model enables:\n* Bookmarking\n* Sharing\n* Opening listings in new tabs\n* Browser back and forward navigation\n* Server rendering\n* Analytics attribution\n* Deep links from blogs and search engines\n* Reliable refresh and session restoration",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
