      "text": "--- State that should generally not appear in the URL:\n* Open modal state\n* Hovered listing\n* Loading indicators\n* Temporary form drafts\n* Tracking IDs\n* Personally identifying information\n* Session-specific experimentation details",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
