      "updated": 1783981034645,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "*** Each locale should:\n* Canonicalize to itself\n* Link back to alternate locale versions\n* Use localized metadata\n* Provide server-rendered localized content\n* Avoid automatically redirecting crawlers based only on IP",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "*** Each locale should:\n* Canonicalize to itself\n* Link back to alternate locale versions\n* Use localized metadata\n* Provide server-rendered localized content\n* Avoid automatically redirecting crawlers based only on IP",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "RAceGJaGHbVe83uQ1yRuu",
      "type": "text",
